{{also|æsthetic}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|æsthetic||dated}}
* {{alter|en|esthetic||US}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|de|Ästhetik}} or {{der|en|fr|esthétique}}, both from {{der|en|NL.|aesthēticus}}, itself borrowed from {{der|en|grc|αἰσθητικός||of sense perception}}, from {{m|grc|αἰσθάνομαι||I feel}}; analysable as {{suf|en|aesthesis|alt1=aesthe(sis)|tic}}.

Cognates include {{cog|gem-pro|*awiz|t=obvious}}, {{cog|sa|आविस्|tr=āvís|t=manifestly, evidently}} and {{cog|la|audiō}}.

